{"id":1550010,"shortDescription":"¡Te damos la bienvenida a Fern Island! En la piel de Abrill, sumérgete en la cultura de la isla, descubre sus secretos más ocultos y domina las artes mágicas. ¡Supera los desafíos de la isla para demostrar tu dominio de la magia y convertirte en la bruja más conocida del lugar!","developers":["Enjoy Studio S.A."],"publishers":["indie.io"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Compat. parcial con mando","Steam Cloud","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"27 FEB 2024","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550010/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1791996071","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550010/ss_c8a8167320091344dcbd009a1bdb7b043e1a6422.600x338.jpg?t=1791996071","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550010/ss_c8a8167320091344dcbd009a1bdb7b043e1a6422.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791996071"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550010/ss_32fabc818b4e824a279def36a85f7cc27a71992f.600x338.jpg?t=1791996071","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550010/ss_32fabc818b4e824a279def36a85f7cc27a71992f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791996071"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550010/ss_29660aa0052e203e38a0873893da388f1bb85a68.600x338.jpg?t=1791996071","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550010/ss_29660aa0052e203e38a0873893da388f1bb85a68.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791996071"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550010/ss_0a19eab97fea1c21eb7ae8061f7337c0817a8588.600x338.jpg?t=1791996071","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550010/ss_0a19eab97fea1c21eb7ae8061f7337c0817a8588.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791996071"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550010/ss_179af6aac3aaae97ecb5